Trademark is a mark used to distinguish one operator’s brand or service from other operators’ goods or services.
Therefore, in modern business activities, infringement or misappropriation of famous trademarks by touching porcelain and pretending to be famous brands are common in all walks of life.
In March last year, Zhouming’s trademark merchants also infringed.
However, after years of development, a number of influential enterprises in the world have been born in the industry, and brand trademarks have naturally been born.
In the face of the cruel market competition, some enterprise operators have played this illegal means of using other enterprise brand trademarks.
When fake and shoddy products are prevalent, the ultimate harm is the interests of the whole industry.
Zhouming’s ability to protect its rights quickly benefits from its “China famous trademark” certification.
It is not limited to the same or similar goods or services.
