What is the main difference between constant current and constant voltage of LED display?
The output current of the constant current drive is constant, but the output DC voltage will change in a certain range with the size of the load resistance.
The output voltage of constant voltage drive is fixed, but the output current will change with the increase or decrease of load.
Because of the constant current drive products, it has more circuits and chips, so that the current can be kept constant, which increases the service life and stability of LED display.
