As the core of LED display, LED chip plays an important role in the development of small spacing led.
Today, let’s take you to understand the chip side solutions of small spacing LED display screen:
It seems that the design of smaller layout can be solved as long as the needs of the design of smaller layout.
One is the limit of suction nozzle.
At present, the inner diameter of the suction nozzle with cost performance is about 80um.
First, the solder wire plate, chip electrode must be large enough, otherwise the reliability of welding wire cannot be guaranteed.
The second is that the distance between electrodes must be large enough, otherwise, the two welding wires will inevitably interfere with each other.
There are two limitations in the process of chip processing.
Generally, the minimum distance between p electrode and chip edge is limited to more than 14 μ M. The other is the limitation of the ability of LED screen to cut.
When the wafer diameter increases from 2 inches to 4 inches, or to 6 inches in the future, the difficulty of slicing lobes increases, that is, the size of the chip that can be processed increases.
Based on the above reasons, the author boldly predicts that after the chip size is reduced to 17mil2, the chip design and processing capacity is close to the limit, and there is no space for reduction, unless there is a big breakthrough in the chip technology scheme.
LED display chip factory improves internal quantum effect through epitaxial program optimization, and improves external quantum effect by adjusting the structure of LED display chip.
The so-called small current is relative to the current of the conventional indoor LED display and outdoor LED display.
The small gap LED display chip needs to work in the non-linear working area near 0, and the current is small.
The analysis of the brightness and wavelength dispersion of large batch chips shows that the dispersion of the nonlinear working area is much larger than that of the linear working area.
The first way to solve this problem is to optimize the epitaxial direction, which is to reduce the lower limit of linear working area; secondly, the optimization of chip light separation, which distinguishes different characteristic chips.
The relationship between capacitance characteristics and conventional measurement items is not clear, and there are those who are waiting to summarize.
But in general, the factors that affect the reliability of LED display on chip are ESD and IR.
According to IC industry, more than 50% of the chip failures are related to ESD.
However, under the same epitaxial and the same chip structure, the decrease of chip size will inevitably lead to the weakening of ESD capability.
IR is the reverse leakage, which is usually used to measure the reverse current value of the chip at a fixed reverse voltage.
In the chip grading, the chip with weak ESD capability and IR performance can be effectively removed by strict grading standard, thus improving the reliability of the chip after screen.
