if you want to repair by yourself, you should pay attention to the installation position and maintenance method of LED display.
in a word, for the problem of incomplete LED display, you can first check the power supply and signal circuit problems, if these are confirmed to be OK, then check the LED display module problems, and scientifically check one by one.
So when there is a problem with a row of LED displays, we should replace the board that is not normal at the beginning of this row, or jump this board directly with a long cable, and then check whether the board at the back shows normal.
Turn on the power and check whether the indicator light of the control card is on; if not, check whether there is 5V power supply and whether the LED display can display the content.
If it can be found, the function of the control card sending content is good; If you can’t find it, check whether the communication line is connected properly.
As long as these two functions are good, the control card is good.
if the power supply is broken, it will directly cause several boards not to light or not normal at the same time, because one power supply controls several boards at the same time.
The most direct detection method is to take the DC voltage of Wan meter to test whether the output voltage is between 4.5 V and 5.5 v. If it is not in this range, it is necessary to consider replacing the LED display power supply.
