The LED display technology has been widely discussed in the field of flat panel display today, from the monochrome display in the early 1980s to the double basic display in the late 1980s, and then to the three basic color (full color) display in the mid-1990s.
The color processing technology of LED display screen includes the basic wavelength selection, the allocation of white field color temperature, and then the color space transformation to improve the color reduction degree and the multi base color (greater than three basic colors) processing to expand the color range to reproduce more natural colors.
Some of the choices of LED basic color wavelength are to achieve good visual effect, some are to meet people’s habits, and some are also the provisions of industry standards, national standards and even international standards.
Although the cost is low, the color range of the display screen is small, the color reduction degree is poor and the brightness is low.
For example, the stock market display is used to using red to indicate the rise of stock price, green for the decline of stock price, and yellow for flat market.
Therefore, the selection of the basic color wavelength is one of the important links of LED display.
However, the color unevenness can not be corrected, and can only be improved by subdividing and screening led color coordinates.
It is feasible to make the color uniformity improved by comprehensive correction.
Therefore, it is important to correct the chromaticity uniformity.
ABCD), any point of green mixed with a certain proportion of red and blue can adjust the color coordinate of mixed color to the intersection o of line Cr and line dB.
However, the corrected saturation is obviously decreased.
At present, the uniform distribution method of LED will bring confusion to the correction of chromaticity uniformity.
We gave a hint about it.
However, the color color coordinates of red and green LED have a large deviation from that of PAL TV red and green blue (see Table 1), which makes the color reduction degree of LED full color screen poor.
Therefore, the color reduction processing technology came into being.
one: to transform the color coordinate space of the red, green and blue three basic color LED, so that the color coordinate between LED and PAL TV is as close as possible, so as to greatly improve the color reduction degree of LED display.
The other is to correct the most sensitive color gamut of human eyes, while the color regions which are not sensitive to other people’s eyes can reduce the original saturation as much as possible.
From Figure 3, it can be seen that the color saturation of LED full color screen in the yellow and blue areas with rich colors in the great nature is seriously insufficient.
In fact, when determining the driving strength of yellow and green two basic colors, we follow the following three principles: (1) the purpose of increasing the yellow and green basic colors is to expand the color range and thus improve the saturation of color.
Under the guidance of the above three principles, we can find the 3 + 2 multi base color treatment method according to the law of gravity center.
In conclusion, we discuss three aspects: (1) how to improve the uniformity of color of LED display; (2) how to improve the color reduction degree of LED display; (3) how to expand the color domain and restore more natural colors.
In some aspects, fish and bear palm can not be obtained simultaneously.
Therefore, we must weigh all the performance comprehensively from the system perspective, grasp the order of each processing and increase the depth of signal processing, so that the LED full color display can display a colorful and colorful wonderful world.
