If you have been playing for a long time Minecraft in single player mode or if you are new to the game and want to know about the multiplayer mode and what its servers are, do not worry, I will explain shortly what the Servers Minecraft and Everything you need to know about them.
First we must know that it is a server of Minecraft and this is a multiplayer server that is operated and managed by a player or also by a company. We must also know that the term "server" in many cases it refers to a network of servers that are connected to each other, instead of being a single machine.
Standard: These servers mostly have common or normal maps, allowing players to build or destroy whatever they want, taking into account the rules that the same server has established in it.
PvP or PvP (Player versus Player or Player versus Player): Essentially these servers are based on the fights between players, they are literally pitched battles in every corner of the map to add points for each player you defeat.
