a carrot and a bowl. Then we will go to our 'crafting table' and we will place the ingredients in the following way: In the first horizontal line we will place the cooked rabbit in the middle box, in the second line we will place the carrot, the cooked potato and the mushroom (in this same order), and in the last line we will place the bowl in the middle box; and voila we will obtain the rabbit stew, this will increase us 10 hunger points and 12 saturation points.
