Surely you have seen certain profiles on Tinder with numbers, words or codes that you do not fully understand. A very characteristic one is to see in other people's profiles the number 420.
El 420 is a type of code that means "Time for marijuana", as well as theWorld Cannabis Day. It is celebrated every year onApril 20(20/4).
In the case of tinder, there are many people who place this characteristic number on their profile, with which They imply that they like to consume this herb. It is a modality that many people use to connect with profiles that they also like to consume.
However the most popular is a story that goes back to the years 1971 It is said that a gang from California (USA), known as The Waldos, met every day in a plaza outside his institute to smoke marijuana.
But.. What does this have as a reference?, because they were famous for always getting together to smoke at 4: 20 in the afternoon, an hour after what their classes usually finished.
In this way, the number 420 has been known since those times as a reference to the time of smoke this weed. It has been passed from generation to generation and is known worldwide.
