Constipation, occurs when the bird cannot excrete normally for a long time. It goes through an inadequate diet, and we can correct it by giving it enough water and a variety of foods.
Respiratory Akaryosis, caused by mites causes difficulty in breathing of our inseparable. If he does, we will see that he looks more agitated, sleepy and makes irritating sounds in his throat; antibiotics are prescribed.
AvitaminosisIt occurs in chicks and is a very slow growth. It is produced by a lack of vitamins A, B and C, also due to poor feeding.
